---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";
const values = [
  ["01", "先理解问题", "不急着进入方案。先定义目标、约束和真正需要解决的部分。"],
  ["02", "让过程可见", "保留判断与取舍，让作品不仅能展示结果，也能解释为什么这样做。"],
  ["03", "保持可持续", "选择能够长期维护的结构、审美和工作方式，而不是追逐短期效果。"],
];
---
<BaseLayout title="个人介绍" description={`关于${site.author}，以及持续创作的方向。`}>
  <header class="profile-hero">
    <div class="container profile-hero__grid">
      <div class="issue-index reveal-up"><span>01</span><small>PROFILE</small></div>
      <div class="reveal-up">
        <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT ME</p>
        <h1>保持好奇，<br />持续交付。</h1>
      </div>
      <p class="profile-hero__lead reveal-up">我正在建立一套把学习、开发和视觉表达连接起来的工作方式。网站既是个人档案，也是长期练习的现场。</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="container about-grid">
    <div class="about-monogram reveal-up" data-tilt>
      <span>M</span>
      <small>PERSONAL ARCHIVE / 2026</small>
    </div>
    <div class="about-copy reveal-up">
      <p class="eyebrow">WHO I AM</p>
      <h2>我是{site.author}，{site.role}。</h2>
      <p>我关注一个想法如何从模糊问题变成清晰结构，再变成可以体验的作品。相比只展示最终结果，我更愿意记录过程、取舍和下一步。</p>
      <p>目前的关注方向包括 Web 开发、交互设计、数据可视化、个人知识管理和 AI 辅助创作。</p>
      <div class="profile-tags"><span>Web Development</span><span>Interaction</span><span>Data</span><span>Knowledge</span><span>AI</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="editorial-section editorial-section--values">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading reveal-up"><div><p class="section-heading__eyebrow"><span></span>MY PRINCIPLES</p><h2>我如何做事</h2></div><div class="section-heading__side"><p>不追求复杂，只追求清晰、真实和可以继续迭代。</p></div></div>
      <div class="value-grid">
        {values.map(([number, title, text]) => <article class="value-card reveal-up"><span>{number}</span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{text}</p></article>)}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container about-now reveal-up">
    <span>NOW / 2026</span>
    <h2>持续完善个人网站、项目案例与数据表达，把零散实践整理成完整作品。</h2>
    <div><a href="/experience">看项目经历</a><a href="/works">看作品展示</a></div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
